image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5215451)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zzzzzac&quot;  &gt;ZZZZZac&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;的“叔叔我啊，最喜欢二次元了”&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/monroe-products&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4715842&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608342640&quot; alt=&quot;Monroe Products&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4715842)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/monroe-products&quot;  &gt;Monroe Products&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;的“憎恶的美学。”&lt;/p&gt;
