 src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3975741&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608342641" alt="wlft" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3975741)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wlft" >wlft</a></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">您吃了吗？<strong>（被动）</strong></td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"> <p>在第四赛道取得第一名</p> </td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">遥控大便，可发声款式</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tenth-lee" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5226483&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608342641" alt="Tenth Lee" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5226483)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tenth-lee" >Tenth Lee</a></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"> <p>彩色压印<strong>（被动）</strong></p> </td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"> <p>在第一赛道获得前五名，且该scp有具体可绘制的形象或文档中有具体可绘制的场景。</p> </td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"> <p>由赞助者为获奖作品绘制大幅彩色插图<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-992125-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>。</p> </td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tenth-lee" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5226483&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608342641" alt="Tenth Lee" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5226483)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tenth-lee" >Tenth Lee</a></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"> <p>网点贴纸<strong>（被动）</strong></p> </td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"> <p>在第二赛道获得前三名，且该故事有清晰故事脉络和角色性格。</p> </td> <td style="padding